                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 2126/416.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Furniss to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Port au
                                Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-12-21"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The inauguration of the President took place yesterday morning without
                    incident.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Furniss.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
